2026-08-04T10:59:21.158+08:00  INFO 26896 --- [ai-agent] [ForkJoinPool.commonPool-worker-3] c.d.aiagent.agent.ToolCallAgent          : 工具名称：generatePDF, 参数：{"fileName":"shenzhen_university_date_plan.pdf","content":"DATE PLAN NEAR SHENZHEN UNIVERSITY YUEHAI CAMPUS\n\nStarting point: Shenzhen University Yuehai Campus, 3688 Nanhai Avenue, Nanshan District, Shenzhen.\n\nRecommended main route: Talent Park + Xianqiuge Book Bar + dinner\nSuggested time: 15:30-21:30\n\n15:30 Meet at the campus. Bring sunscreen, umbrella, power bank and water.\n16:00 Travel to Talent Park. Verify the live route in Amap or Baidu Maps.\n16:30-17:30 Walk around the lake and chat. Suggested questions: a recent small goal, an ideal weekend, and an idea for the next date.\n17:30-18:15 Rest at Xianqiuge Book Bar, have coffee or a light snack.\n18:15-19:00 Take relaxed photos by the lake during sunset and blue hour.\n19:00-20:30 Dinner near Talent Park, Coastal City or MixC World.\n20:30-21:15 Dessert or a short night walk.\n21:15-21:30 Return safely to the campus.\n\nFIVE DATE OPTIONS WITHIN ABOUT 5 KM\n\n1. Shenzhen Talent Park - best overall\nAddress: No. 3329 Keyuan South Road, Nanshan District.\nPark hours: 06:00-23:00. Xianqiuge Book Bar: 08:00-22:30.\nHighlights: lake, lawns, skyline, night views, coffee and conversation.\nEstimated budget for two: RMB 130-430.\nOfficial source: http://www.sz.gov.cn/szzt2010/gysz/csgy/content/mpost_10826592.html\nPhoto reference: https://you.ctrip.com/sight/shenzhen26/4977342.html\n\n2. Shenzhen Bay Park - best for sunset\nAddress: Shenzhen Bay coastline.\nHours: 06:00-23:00. Bailupo Book Bar: 10:00-20:00.\nHighlights: sea breeze, sunset, coastal walking and photography.\nEstimated budget for two: RMB 60-250 plus dinner.\nOfficial source: http://cgj.sz.gov.cn/xsmh/gysz/twf/tyyd/content/post_10841266.html\nPhoto reference: https://gs.ctrip.com/html5/you/sight/Shenzhen26/1508177.html\n\n3. MixC World / Wanxiang Tiandi - best for rain or heat\nAddress: No. 9668 Shennan Avenue, Nanshan District.\nHours: Sun-Thu 10:00-22:00; Fri-Sat 10:00-22:30.\nHighlights: art installations, restaurants, shopping and cinema.\nEstimated budget for two: RMB 300-660.\nSource and photo reference: https://sz.bendibao.com/wangdian/dian/5866086.shtm\n\n4. Coastal City - easy dinner and movie\nAddress: No. 33 Wenxin 5th Road, Nanshan District.\nHours: Sun-Thu 10:00-22:00; Fri-Sat 10:00-22:30.\nHighlights: restaurants, IMAX cinema, KTV, exhibitions and shopping.\nEstimated budget for two: RMB 320-660.\nSource and photo reference: https://sz.bendibao.com/wangdian/dian/5866066.shtm\n\n5. Nanshan Museum - best for culture and quiet conversation\nOfficial website: https://www.nanshanmuseum.com/index\nAppointment: https://www.nanshanmuseum.com/appointmentIndex\nPlan: reserve entry, choose one or two exhibitions, discuss favorite exhibits over coffee, then have dinner.\nEstimated budget for two: RMB 210-430.\n\nRAIN / HOT WEATHER ALTERNATIVES\n\nA. Wanxiang Tiandi: art installation photos, dessert, shopping, dinner and cinema.\nB. Coastal City: afternoon tea, exhibition or shopping, dinner, IMAX or KTV.\nC. Nanshan Museum: exhibition, coffee review, dinner.\n\nBUDGET GUIDE FOR TWO\nEconomic: park plus simple meal, RMB 130-250.\nComfortable: Talent Park, book bar and dinner, RMB 230-430.\nIndoor rainy-day plan: mall, dinner and movie, RMB 320-660.\nCultural plan: museum, coffee and dinner, RMB 210-430.\n\nIMPORTANT NOTES\nDistances are approximate and depend on the campus gate and destination entrance. Check live navigation, weather, opening hours, reservations and restaurant queues before departure. Park and museum information may change. Online images are for atmosphere and composition reference; copyright belongs to the original creators or websites. Confirm permission before commercial reuse.\n\nSources: Shenzhen Municipal Government; Shenzhen Urban Management and Comprehensive Law Enforcement Bureau; Nanshan Museum; Shenzhen Bendibao; Coastal Group; Ctrip. Compiled June 2026."}
